at)            母牛肉乾(Beef meat)            母牛肉乾(Beef meat)            母牛肉乾(Beef meat)> [動作完成。] [回報地點]: /open/world1/tmr/cow_area/field2/room29","author":"寒日(dragongod)",]),(["title":"● 如來金佛像(Rulaifo statue)","time":1193379871,"msg":"你來到了凌雲峰-上天梯缺口處。;編譯時段錯誤﹕/open/world1/tmr/advbonze/hill17.c line 49: Warning: Unused local variable 'buddha' around the end of line你來到了凌雲峰頂-缺口處。 [回報地點]: /open/world1/tmr/advbonze/summit1","author":"墮落(diroe)",]),(["title":"●編譯時段錯誤﹕","time":1193415220,"msg":"編譯時段錯誤﹕/open/world1/tmr/dragoncity/npc/kou-zhong.c line 87: Warning: Unused local variable 'i' around the end of line少帥府－客廳 -     這裡是少帥府的客廳。廳雖不大，卻佈置的挺雅致。東壁懸掛著四幅屏條，繪的是梅蘭竹菊四種花卉；西壁懸掛的是春夏秋冬。內廳居中的是一張八仙桌。桌上端放著一套茶具，兩旁擺\放著四張檀香椅，顯得極為古樸。廳角各擺\放著一盆牡丹花，似乎給這裡帶來一絲暖意。    這裡明顯的出口是 south 和 north。  天刀身意 寇仲(Kou-zhong master) 正站在這裡 [回報地點]: /open/world1/tmr/dragoncity/house3","author":"墮落(diroe)",]),(["title":"●編譯時段錯誤﹕","time":1194116881,"msg":"只見妳施展苦練許\久的輕功\，向上一躍便消失的無影無蹤了..編譯時段錯誤﹕/open/world1/whoami/birdarea/bird2.c line 53: Warning: Unused local variable 'ob' around            [回報地點]: /open/world1/whoami/birdarea/bird2","author":"墮落(diroe)",]),(["title":"●編譯時段錯誤﹕","time":1194116911,"msg":"只見妳施展苦練許\久的輕功\，向上一躍便消失的無影無蹤了..編譯時段錯誤﹕/open/world1/whoami/birdarea/bird4.c line 54: Warning: Unused local variable 'ob' around the end of line編譯時段錯誤﹕/open/world1/whoami/birdarea/bird4.c line 69: Warning: Unused local variable 'ob' around   [回報地點]: /open/world1/whoami/birdarea/bird4","author":"墮落(diroe)",]),(["title":"●編譯時段錯誤","time":1194438352,"msg":"編譯時段錯誤﹕/open/world1/cominging/area/npc/minstrel.c line 81: Warning: Unused local variable 'user' around the end of line編譯時段錯誤﹕/open/world1/cominging/area/npc/minstrel.c line 122: Warning: Unused local variable 'file_w' around the end of line編譯時段錯誤﹕/open/world1/cominging/area/npc/minstrel.c line 122: Warning: Unused local variable 'a' around the end of line編譯時段錯誤﹕/open/world1/cominging/area/npc/minstrel.c line 141: Warning: Unused local varia